        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678910/extras/b5e5d3ce1d45a3d28c5bb029928ed5f5.avif?t=1785921030\" width=600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678910/extras/41a06e08ed4e18bbe8407ae6e47af115.poster.avif?t=1785921030\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678910/extras/41a06e08ed4e18bbe8407ae6e47af115.webm?t=1785921030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678910/extras/41a06e08ed4e18bbe8407ae6e47af115.mp4?t=1785921030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ball Blast is an arcade shooter where you control a cannon and destroy rocks falling from the sky. Upgrade your gear to complete levels and beat powerful bosses!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every rock has a number—hit it that many times and boom! it splits into two rocks with half the number and double the speed, turning the field into fast-moving chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with a friend for double firepower. Beat hundreds of levels, survive endless waves, and climb the world leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up coins and unlock new cannons: a wide-spread shotgun, a boomerang that swings back and spinning saw blades that slice through rocks as they fall. Upgrade power-ups like a piercing laser beam, explosive drones, and huge shockwaves to wipe out waves in a flash!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CO-OP: Team up with a friend and fend off the falling rocks together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Leaderboards: Survive as long as you can and get the best score in the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful Cannons: Choose between basic, shotgun, boomerang, and saw cannons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devastating powers: Buy and upgrade powerful abilities to destroy everything!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Levels: Defeat epic bosses and protect the bridge from destruction!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Replayability: Complete hundreds of unique levels and challenges!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rocks won’t stop bouncing—are you ready to keep blasting?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678910/extras/b5e5d3ce1d45a3d28c5bb029928ed5f5.avif?t=1785921030\" width=600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678910/extras/41a06e08ed4e18bbe8407ae6e47af115.poster.avif?t=1785921030\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678910/extras/41a06e08ed4e18bbe8407ae6e47af115.webm?t=1785921030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678910/extras/41a06e08ed4e18bbe8407ae6e47af115.mp4?t=1785921030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ball Blast is an arcade shooter where you control a cannon and destroy rocks falling from the sky. Upgrade your gear to complete levels and beat powerful bosses!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every rock has a number—hit it that many times and boom! it splits into two rocks with half the number and double the speed, turning the field into fast-moving chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with a friend for double firepower. Beat hundreds of levels, survive endless waves, and climb the world leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up coins and unlock new cannons: a wide-spread shotgun, a boomerang that swings back and spinning saw blades that slice through rocks as they fall. Upgrade power-ups like a piercing laser beam, explosive drones, and huge shockwaves to wipe out waves in a flash!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CO-OP: Team up with a friend and fend off the falling rocks together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Leaderboards: Survive as long as you can and get the best score in the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful Cannons: Choose between basic, shotgun, boomerang, and saw cannons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devastating powers: Buy and upgrade powerful abilities to destroy everything!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Levels: Defeat epic bosses and protect the bridge from destruction!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Replayability: Complete hundreds of unique levels and challenges!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rocks won’t stop bouncing—are you ready to keep blasting?</p>",
